                                "sense_id": "8bd1656b-8c24-3b58-9af4-1bd23f54aabe",
                                "text": "But while the effluent beams of the sun, and their quickening power in the natural sphere, furnish a good illustration of my idea of the Holy Spirit, I may, perhaps, illustrate the idea still better by a reference to human thoughts and affections […]"
